On Mon, 26 Apr 2004, Coywolf Qi Hunt wrote:

> >>========================================================================
> >>--- linux-2.6.5/arch/i386/boot/setup.S.orig	Sat Mar  6 23:49:33 2004
> >>+++ linux-2.6.5/arch/i386/boot/setup.S	Sun Mar  7 07:23:10 2004
